{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "f30898f2a414a524c36539ab301b68d7f52fe15c60fd9c08815a4217dbe5f2f9", "ja": "『I.V.』の価値", "zh": "『I.V.』的价值", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3baaa7f3021abc3e27123977ccd6facceb0f142d133766b1b63a8278bfe533d", "ja": "スクールに馴染めないままレッスンを続ける\n真珠星。そこに織姫の相方の藍と神宮寺が\nやってきて、研修生達の前で『新生I.V.』\nオーディションがあると発表。真珠星はその\n前段階のバックダンサー選抜挑戦を決める。", "zh": "真珠星在还没融入学校的情况下继续着训练。织姫的搭档藍和神宮寺来到这里，在练习生们面前宣布将举行“新生I.V.”选拔。真珠星决定挑战作为前阶段的伴舞选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "93e8cbeb01df01cefd0c175a4fb5b91080f93618c08590916b32c1997c9d09fd", "ja": "厳しいレッスンがひたすら続く毎日……\nスクールでの日々を、私はうまくこなせずにいた。", "zh": "每天都在一刻不停地进行严苛训练……\n我始终没能很好地适应学校的生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "22848be0fff8f14524ab7429cb47ef1635baf068505a9d49f936940b772f3aa3", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……っ！\nいたた、昨日の筋肉痛がまだ……。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……！\n好痛，昨天的肌肉酸痛还没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "949a97a9fcbf6ac501943b81742856534ce0aba174049c5efe7b359e9e71bdae", "ja": "真珠星さん、大丈夫？\nテーピング用のテープあるけど、使う？", "zh": "真珠星，没事吧？\n我这儿有贴扎用的胶带，要用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "ea686ecb80b2fae9fa7481f35736bb5d41012abbecb1b6d569976a28a69fb866", "ja": "あっ、ありがとう……。\nいいの？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……  \n真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "e0cdc83a9c8ede4f2bf1a9f19d8f1b432a5ae62ed5cdce3a4f82a7ef637bd81c", "ja": "いいのいいの！　……どう？\nスクールには、慣れてきた？", "zh": "没关系的啦！……怎么样？\n对培育学校还习惯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "e0e7e1c0d6a721cb4767a81dceb6a74fa7551517278cac1ad16d1186d7d18f27", "ja": "どうだろ……。\nいまいち、かも。", "zh": "怎么说呢……\n好像不太行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "921c367e0555ee5033a44335e06f3c30dc089ab2f0a8bb7ae1b4503b443f7770", "ja": "私にお姉ちゃんみたいな才能がないってことは、\n最初からわかってたんだけどね。", "zh": "我一开始就知道，自己没有像姐姐那样的才能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "7bb13b0184ea8d3994035041365d09099416d122f6e0b3124127f6cd53a5eb10", "ja": "……。\nあ、あの……！", "zh": "……。\n那个、请问……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1008_traineea", "source_sha256": "163bb70a82c4f0e89f86036cae7fcc956a96596b2c6618d0bb9409a2f5126fa5", "ja": "やる気ないなら、やめたら？\n他の人の迷惑だから。", "zh": "要是没干劲的话，不如放弃吧？\n这样只会给别人添麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1009_traineeb", "source_sha256": "d4aef8851855f82365ce76815875b280da1eeeaecb30aec5a441a516339f090c", "ja": "半端な気持ちでアイドルやられたら\n周りのモチベに関わること、気付かないわけ？", "zh": "如果抱着半吊子的心态当偶像，\n难道没意识到会影响周围人的干劲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "4d616d3744dbc95d9041ff81b147bc3688abb0e855212cb2bb3456d9011b02ae", "ja": "……。\nなるさん、うるさいから、あっちで続けよう。", "zh": "……。\n鸣小姐，这里太吵了，我们换个地方继续吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1eb933ad96e6ebc7bdf99527407a2e376d3deee00adbc54c314c36659add07f", "ja": "えっ……う、うん！", "zh": "诶……嗯、嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1012_traineea", "source_sha256": "981a2891dc4d74c45c9d67766e30d838f39dfcc27fe6a072989a9adb973d05c0", "ja": "……はっ。\n流石、似た者同士って感じ？", "zh": "……哈。\n真不愧是同一类人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1013_traineeb", "source_sha256": "5186f1627c45bd264d494eace07c6e6ba10ae045507e64edbacea7e88fe30f8c", "ja": "いいんじゃない、ほっとけば。\nあの調子なら、そのうちいなくなるでしょ。", "zh": "放着不管不就好了。\n照她那副样子，过不了多久就会自己消失吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "7bb185656be96314bad40f453c882eb5779ff53d1de4ba78c1cfbb0e362d5284", "ja": "陰口を言われても、黙っていた。本当の事だから。\nけど、そんなある日……", "zh": "即使被人在背后说坏话，我也一直沉默着。因为那都是真的。不过，就在那一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "fa9fcf2d5837613da781c25d28dcf48c3e4ffcab201411ad7b10bda10115dd02", "ja": "全員集まったわね。早速だけど、\nミーティングを始めるわ。……藍、挨拶を。", "zh": "大家都到齐了。那就马上开始会议吧。……蓝，打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "c781b63c7446ebf231a3a692075ff084c39c423d15237f83b61b32accfa651ab", "ja": "笹森藍です。\nみんな、よろしくね。", "zh": "我是笹森蓝。大家，请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1017_traineetachi", "source_sha256": "d1c92cd82d0497297dadfdb79533e3b6855e573eeacd979918e11054dacf5414", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！！", "zh": "请多关照！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "b83222e00863f46609c0436fc79a97544fbf141f88bf7e3f10bbb932782c54ac", "ja": "（笹森藍……今ごろ来た！　「私がアイドルのことを\n教えてあげる」とか言ってたくせに……）", "zh": "（笹森蓝……现在才来！明明还说过“我来教你偶像的事”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1019_traineea", "source_sha256": "eb5bebb06790d2101b1a7811eaa558952fe44f0c5efa8598a809e3a5cea47fd6", "ja": "あの。もしかしてこの後、\n藍さんと特別レッスンですか？", "zh": "那个。难不成这之后，\n要和蓝小姐进行特别练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "390563433437a9b78cbc42f84614daafb1871c7e7fd5afdf87779285136f13c0", "ja": "ごめんなさい。この後は仕事があって。\n……けど、近いうちに一緒にする事になるわ。", "zh": "对不起，之后还有工作。\n……不过，我们很快就会一起做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "d8d6b95d959f3d28c7b36c2e11bcc37ccbe3f5198828e4063aa027a80b701099", "ja": "（近いうちにって、どういう意味だろう。\n……というか、この人……）", "zh": "（“过些日子”……是什么意思呢？\n……不对，话说这个人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "47177f6ff0909b779348adc3b7b912a73f85d5f18d8a5facc09be2431e3853a8", "ja": "（この人が本当に、お姉ちゃんの引き立て役なんて\n言われてたの？　……信じられない）", "zh": "（这个人真的被说成是衬托姐姐的陪衬吗？……真让人难以置信。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "489a6a4a39b9f3e76d17ccaabfd37701cbdb31146af8e52a33d3226a948914cb", "ja": "（オーラっていうか、迫力とか存在感なら、\nお姉ちゃんよりもずっと……）", "zh": "（要说是气场，不如说是魄力和存在感的话，\n比姐姐强得多……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "c614eca535057af376ecf70ce3ae0d4b1ecae1e512d08c0e0178b1c1bb44522c", "ja": "今日のミーティング内容は、新生I.V.について。\nオーディションで、新しいメンバーを決めます。", "zh": "今天的会议内容，是关于新生I.V.的。\n要通过试镜，选出新的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "9d209aa3bde2fbc0bfa541874cb1c37ef8f3823f972b431a4dfd296cb08feb41", "ja": "し、新生I.V.……？", "zh": "新、新生I.V.……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "f6ef32d83073b15bd33425852c96048f152ec553403d7ee425cb8c1d415e7255", "ja": "それは……\n織姫さんの代わりを決める、って事ですか？", "zh": "这就是说……\n要决定谁来替代织姬小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "5479bf1d1630eafe4ae84082ffc8492f2547d064e0bccd9a1c1c7435c7716cc9", "ja": "ええ。不幸は起きてしまったけど、\n残された者は先に進まなくては。", "zh": "是的。虽然不幸已经发生了，\n但留下来的人必须继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "03f92f32aa4f9a5fdcb24e8ec83ed2f5ea67ffcf4b3f2e68a8d2696026db27af", "ja": "I.V.の新しいメンバー……？\n何それ……私、そんなの聞いてない！", "zh": "I.V.的新成员……？\n怎么会……我可从没听说过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "336c4cd64983c3044ad2a4786d1b6760800bbe5f5a618eee12b1dce9d4a69522", "ja": "そりゃあ、今言ったからね。", "zh": "那当然了，因为我也是刚刚才说的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "69331bdd40e1180b59e22d8a882dba193b4d00b9f29716d7d71de537a78ce075", "ja": "I.V.という名前には、価値があるの。\nこのまま消すわけにはいかないわ。", "zh": "I.V.这个名字，是有价值的。\n可不能就这么让它消失。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "0479a3c43dad33cfe35480381dbce2195016dfff60bf47e3f34c2f6876a615ba", "ja": "そんな……それじゃ、お姉ちゃんが……。\n私は、そんなの認めない！", "zh": "怎么会……那样的话，姐姐她……。\n我绝不承认这种事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "33e083b4022491b6aab6fa6fd6b1412989104b2aa59c99af035ac5a8b190384b", "ja": "あなたの許可は必要ないのよ。気に入らないなら、\n自分がなればいいんじゃないの？", "zh": "不需要得到你的许可哦。你要是不满意的话，\n自己去当不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d1b196ddd38526eb36049f0d607fae504b961eae49098d028a3e4106f8225ca", "ja": "えっ。なるって……。", "zh": "诶。成为……是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "6627526dfeec58b519a622f2394cc1e764ffbd2c5711dd6f99f4b8844b40c14d", "ja": "新生I.V.……つまり、私の相方にね。\n出来るのなら、だけど。", "zh": "成为新生I.V.……也就是说，成为我的搭档。\n如果能做到的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "609fc44ef8f8286e6c5bcf94a1ecbcfc8a146a08ffdde9fcdff057535ea86473", "ja": "新生I.V.のオーディション\n前段階として、練習生の実力を見ます。", "zh": "在新生I.V.的试镜中，\n作为前期考察，我们会确认练习生的实力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_04_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "0d41856c2fde533c6315acff3478950b01d40e0976a46f096f38ae848748218c", "ja": "予選代わりに、まず、藍のソロステージの\nバックダンサー選抜を行うわ。", "zh": "作为预选，首先要选拔蓝的个人舞台伴舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
